ERROR at line 1: `extern "C-unwind"` declaration of `risky` requires a build with `panic = "unwind"`, but this build is abort-only. The "C-unwind" ABI propagates an unwinding panic across the FFI boundary, which needs a stack unwinder the abort strategy does not provide (0.8 is abort-only). Use `extern "C"` instead — a body panic auto-aborts at the boundary — or, for a C-shaped error, return a status/`Result`. See design.md § Panic Semantics at the FFI Boundary.
